      <h1 class="jr-h1">Does Collagen Help Acne Scars? What Actually Works</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Almost every page that answers this question is selling a collagen supplement, and most of them quietly swap one problem for another. Here is what no trial has measured, what the randomised evidence does support for each type of scar and mark, and where an oral collagen shot honestly sits.</p>

